\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Sunday, May 14, 2023 (18.00 GMT)\b0\par\par\uc2 1,130 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Mai 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 TURKEY ELECTIONS\par \par \uc2 Erdogan leads in Turkey's presidential election results, according to the media\par \par \uc2 Istanbul. The president of Turkey, the Islamist Recep \uc2 Tayyip Erdogan\uc2 , leads with 53 % of the votes the scrutiny of the presidential elections in Turkey, when a third of all the ballot boxes of the country have been opened, according to the official agency Anadolu. According to these data, still preliminary and unofficial, Erdogan, who has been in power for two decades, would have won his third presidential elections and would remain in office for five more years, while the candidate of the opposition bloc, the social democrat \uc2 Kemal Kili\u231\'00\'E7daroglu\uc2 , would obtain 40%. If no one achieves an absolute majority, a runoff election will be held in two weeks.\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE WAR SITUATION\par \par \uc2 Ukraine presses on in Bajmut, the "prelude" to its counteroffensive\par \par \uc2 Moscow/Kiev. Ukraine increases pressure on Russian troops and continues its advance on the Bajmut front, the "prelude" to its imminent counteroffensive in which Kiev plans to take advantage of the tension between Wagner Group mercenaries and Moscow's military leadership. "Ukrainian forces continue to counterattack in the Bakhmut area," the Institute for the Study of War (ISW) says in its latest report.The analytical center cites Ukrainian ground forces commander Oleksandr Syrsky, who confirmed yesterday that Ukrainian troops are advancing in unspecified areas of the front.\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE WAR GERMANY\par \par \uc2 Zelensky in Germany: "Together we will win and bring peace back to Europe".\par \par \uc2 Berlin. Ukrainian President \uc2 Volodymir Zelensky\uc2  today put on record in writing his appreciation of Germany's support for Ukraine in the Russian war of aggression and expressed his conviction of a victory and a return to peace in Europe. "Together we will win and return peace to Europe," Zelenski said in English in the visitors' book at Bellevue Palace, the official seat of German President \uc2 Frank-Walter Steinmeier\uc2 , before beginning his meeting with the latter, with which he opened his official trip to Germany.\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE WAR\par \par \uc2 Macron says Russia has already suffered a "geopolitical defeat".\par \par \uc2 Paris. Russia has already suffered "a geopolitical defeat" in Ukraine because the war has caused a new enlargement of \uc2 NATO\uc2  and has led it to a "form of vassalage towards China," French President \uc2 Emmanuel Macron\uc2  says Sunday.In an interview with the daily L'Opinion, Macron insists that "Russia has already lost" from a geopolitical point of view, since the invasion of Ukraine moved two traditionally neutral countries, Sweden and Finland, to apply for \uc2 NATO\uc2  membership, which complicates the Russian position in the Baltics.\par \par \uc2 CARLOMAGNO PRIZE\par \par \uc2 Zelenski toasts Europe's eventual victory in the war as he receives the Charlemagne Prize.\par \par \uc2 Berlin. Ukrainian President \uc2 Volodimir Zelensky\uc2  today toasted Europe on his country's eventual victory in the war of aggression launched by Russia on February 24 last year and stressed that the peace harvested now will be the main legacy Europe will leave to its children. "Dear Europe, Ukraine brings you victory," Zelenski said during his more than 25-minute speech in the coronation hall of the Aachen City Hall in western Germany. He stressed that this is a victory not only in this war, but over aggression, annexation, burning of cities, deportation, catastrophe of genocide and a victory that will be shown in the form of peace.\par \par \uc2 MOCHA CYCLONE\par \par \uc2 "Very severe" Cyclone Mocha leaves devastation as it hits Bangladesh and Burma\par \par \uc2 Dhaka. Cyclone Mocha, a "very severe" category cyclone with winds of almost 150 kilometers per hour devastated several areas as it passed along the east coast of Bangladesh, and is moving along the coast towards the northwest of Burma (Myanmar) where, according to the media, some victims and serious damage have already been reported. Hundreds of thousands of people are sheltering in shelters, government facilities, or schools, at the expense of humanitarian agencies in the coastal areas of Bangladesh and Burma for basic supplies and food. At least six deaths were reported in Burma, according to the U.S. non-profit organization \uc2 Radio Free Asia\uc2 , citing local testimonies and civilian organizations, although there is no official death toll at this time.\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL PALESTINE\par \par \uc2 Netanyahu says that the escalation of war with Gaza was "a perfect \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 ".\par \par \uc2 Jerusalem. Israeli Prime Minister \uc2 Benjamin Netanyahu\uc2  today stressed that the five-day conflict with the \uc2 Palestinian Islamic Jihad\uc2  (\uc2 PIJ\uc2 ) in the Gaza Strip, which ended last night, was "a success" and was a "perfect \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 ", and warned that whoever tries to harm Israel "will pay the price". "Last night, we successfully concluded five days of fighting against the Islamic Jihad terrorist organization," Netanyahu said in reference to the bloody escalation in which 33 people were killed in Gaza and two in \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ARGENTINA INFLATION\par \par \uc2 Argentina increases interest rate and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tackle inflation\par \par \uc2 Buenos Aires. Argentina announced on Sunday a set of measures to face the shortage of dollars and the galloping inflation, 108.8 % year-on-year in April, among which are a new increase in the interest rate and the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market, as well as initiatives to sustain consumption and the level of activity. The Ministry of Economy released a list with a series of measures that the head of the Ministry, Sergio Massa, finalized on Saturday with his team -one day after the last inflation figure was known, which exceeded the worst forecasts made by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 - and which, as confirmed to EFE by sources of the Ministry, will be made official on Monday by means of a resolution.\par \par \uc2 ECUADOR LASSO\par \par \uc2 The impeachment trial against Ecuador's president will be held on the 16th.\par \par \uc2 Quito. The Ecuadorian National Assembly (Parliament) summoned legislators to a session on the 16th for the impeachment trial against the president of Ecuador, \uc2 Guillermo Lasso\uc2 , whom the opposition accuses of alleged embezzlement. According to the opposition, Lasso incurred in alleged embezzlement by having knowledge of alleged irregularities in a contract signed by the state-owned company Flota Petrolera del Ecuador (Flopec) and the private firm Amazonas Tanker and not having acted to avoid greater damages to the State.\par \par \uc2 SUDAN REBELLION\par \par \uc2 New fighting in Khartoum before the resumption of the Sudanese dialogue in Saudi Arabia.\par \par \uc2 Khartoum. The Sudanese Army resumed today its bombardment against positions of the paramilitary Rapid Support Forces (RSF) in Khartoum, while awaiting the resumption in Saudi Arabia of negotiations on the conditions to be respected by the parties for the entry of urgent aid to Sudanese civilians after a month of continuous fighting. Residents in Khartoum told EFE that army fighters again attacked posts of the paramilitary group in the south and center of the capital, as well as the southern part of the neighboring city of Um Dorman, where the FAR occupy buildings of some vital institutions. EFE\par \par \uc2 int-fpa/ie\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230514ej5e00exs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
