\par\par \b \uc2 RPT- \highlight22\uc2 Israel central bank FX intervention \highlight\uc2  expectations build\b0\par\par\uc2 531 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 2023\par 07:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Repeats Feb 27 story, text unchanged)\par \par \uc2 By Marc Jones and Steven Scheer\par \par \uc2 LONDON/JERUSALEM, Feb 27 (Reuters) - Expectations mounted on Monday that \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to prop up the shekel which has been one of the weakest \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world since plans were laid out to overhaul the judiciary, analysts said.\par \par \uc2 The shekel has slumped 8% versus the dollar since last month's proposals to give the government greater sway on selecting judges and limit the power of the Supreme Court to strike down legislation.\par \par \uc2 The depreciation, which totals 6% when measured against Israel's main trading partners, has alarmed investors wary that it might be joining the growing list of emerging markets taking a more authoritarian stance to decision making.\par \par \uc2 Analysts at \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  said on Monday that the speed and volatility of the shekel's drop in recent weeks had been "somewhat surprising" and that \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  (\uc2 BoI\uc2 ) may soon have to step in "to break the negative feedback loop".\par \par \uc2 If that did happen, it would be the first time since the shekel became a freely-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  two decades ago that \uc2 BoI\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to strengthen it.\par \par \uc2 "We think the most likely announcement from the \uc2 BoI\uc2  would be the introduction of a Dollar-Shekel swap facility," \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 's analysts said. "Alternatively, given the sizeable level of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could also look to directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market with \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales."\par \par \uc2 Critics of the planned law changes say Prime Minister \uc2 Benjamin Netanyahu\uc2  - on trial on graft charges that he denies - is pursuing steps that will hurt Israel's democratic checks and balances, enable corruption and bring diplomatic isolation.\par \par \uc2 Proponents say the changes are needed to curb what they deem an activist judiciary that interferes in politics.\par \par \uc2 Such has been the scale of the shekel's fall since the plans emerged that local media have reported that \uc2 BoI\uc2  Governor \uc2 Amir Yaron\uc2  held an emergency meeting last week with the country's Financial Stability Committee.\par \par \uc2 This followed a larger-than-expected 50-basis-point interest rate hike at the \uc2 BoI\uc2 's last policy meeting. It was its eighth hike in a row.\par \par \uc2 One of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 's biggest banks, Bank Hapaolim, also said \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be imminent, adding that inflation could also end up at a higher-than-expected 3.5%.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 BoI\uc2  currently forecasts inflation will fall back from 5.4% to the government's target of 1-3% this year, though it estimates a pass-through of as much as 20% to inflation from the dollar-shekel rate.\par \par \uc2 "We believe that if the depreciation of the shekel continues in coming weeks, \uc2 the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," Bank Hapaolim's chief economist, Victor Bahar, wrote.\par \par \uc2 Wall Street investment banks including \uc2 BofA\uc2  and \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  have also raised the possibility of invention. Some have also suggested an out-of cycle rate hike ahead of the \uc2 BoI\uc2 's next scheduled meeting on April 3.\par \par \uc2 "Emergency rate hikes look least likely to us," \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Andrew Heavens)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-3-3T06:00:00.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230228ej2s0114c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
