\par\par \b \uc2 RPT-POLL-Bank of Israel seen on hold next week but rate-cut odds climbing\b0\par\par\uc2 561 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 2020\par 15:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds Reuters Named Item code, no changes to text)\par \par \uc2 * Rate decision due at 1400 GMT on Monday\par \par \uc2 * Rate raised in November 2018, no changes at past nine meetings\par \par \uc2 * Annual inflation at 0.3% in January, well below 1-3% target\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought $6.5 billion of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  since Nov. 25\par \par \uc2 * reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/cb-polls?\par \par \uc2 By Steven Scheer\par \par \uc2 TEL AVIV, Feb 20 (Reuters) - \uc2 Israel's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to leave short-term interest rates unchanged for a 10th straight policy meeting next week, but the chance of a cut in the next few months has grown due to the strengthening shekel and falling inflation.\par \par \uc2 All 16 economists polled by Reuters said the monetary policy committee (MPC) would keep its benchmark rate at 0.25% when the decision is announced on Monday at 4 p.m. (1400 GMT).\par \par \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have held firm on the view that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is the best way to tackle disinflation stemming from a strong shekel. But analysts have questioned this approach and believe a rate reduction may come as early as the next meeting, in April.\par \par \uc2 "It seems that the prospects of a rate reduction later this year \u8211\'20\'13 specifically, at some point during the second quarter \u8211\'20\'13 have been raised, mainly because annual inflation will probably decline sharply, possibly even down to negative levels," said Modi Shafrir, chief strategist of \uc2 Mizrahi Tefahot Bank\uc2 's finance division.\par \par \uc2 Israel's inflation rate slipped to 0.3% in January from 0.6% in December, well below the government's annual target of 1%-3%. Based on bond yields, the rate is forecast to reach 0.7% in a year's time.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, the shekel continues to strengthen and stands at 3.43 per dollar. It had hit 3.416 on Tuesday for its strongest level in two years. Against the euro, the rate of 3.70 is the strongest since mid-2001.\par \par \uc2 Since declaring it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily after its Nov. 25 rates decision, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought some $6.5 billion of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although the shekel is still up 1.2% in the last three months.\par \par \uc2 Amir Kahanovich, chief economist for the Excellence Investment House, said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been a failure and only serves to attract more foreign capital, which supports a stronger shekel.\par \par \uc2 He said to get the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to abandon its policy and lower rates in 2020 there needs to be a significant shock to the stock market, further harm to exports and higher unemployment.\par \par \uc2 For now, the economy remains solid. Growth in 2019 was 3.5% although the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  projects 2.9% growth in 2020.\par \par \uc2 Ofer Klein, head of economics and research at Harel Insurance and Finance, said it was unlikely \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  would make a move before the United States.\par \par \uc2 "Low inflation, the continued strengthening of the shekel and the possibility that global growth will be hit by the outbreak of the virus in China raise the probability that \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  will reduce interest rates in the coming months, but ... it will not act before the Fed," he said. (Reporting by Steven Scheer; Editing by Hugh Lawson) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-2-20T15:49:56.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200220eg2k03awl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
