\par\par \b \uc2 TABLE-Israel  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  reserves rise in July to $115.8 bln\b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 2018\par 12:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2018 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Aug 7 (Reuters) - Israel's foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves\par  rose by $950 million in July to $115.8 billion, its\par second monthly gain in a row, \f28 \uc2 \f2 the Bank of Israel\f28 \uc2 \f2  said on\par Tuesday.\par     \f28 \uc2 \f2 The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Israel\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has cut back on its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the\par market since purchasing $1.8 billion in January, sending\par reserves to a record high of $117.6 billion. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par did not report any purchases in July.\par     The July reserves total included $1.490 billion in special\par drawing rights from the \f28 \uc2 \f2 International Monetary Fund\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\par   \par                          \par                            (in millions of dollars)\par                            July 2018    June 2018     July 2017\par  Reserves                    115,782      114,832       110,110\par  Reserves bought under        12,750       12,750        11,540\par  natgas programme*                                 \par    * - cumulative since start of programme in May 2013\par     \par     -- Israel's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves represent 32.1 percent\par of GDP.\par     -- The bank attributed the rise in reserves last month to\par government transfers from abroad totaling about $337 million, a\par revaluation that increased the reserves by about $602 million,\par and private sector transfers of about $11 million.\par     -- In 2017, reserves grew by $14.6 billion. \f28 \uc2 \f2 The Bank of\par Israel\f28 \uc2 \f2  bought $1.5 billion of foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as part of its\par natural gas programme.\par     \par     For full report click:\par     \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.boi.org.il/en/NewsAndPublications/PressReleases/Pages/07-8-18.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.boi.org.il/en/NewsAndPublications/PressReleases/Pages/07-8-18.aspx}}}\uc2 \f2 \par     \par \par  (Reporting by Ari Rabinovitch, Editing by Ori Lewis)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2018-8-7T11:58:39.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020180807ee8701l3l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
