\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel central bank \highlight\uc2  says  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  weakens shekel 90 pct of time\b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 2018\par 12:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2018 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM, July 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by \uc2 the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the shekel \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  have had a success rate of more than 90 percent since 2009, the bank said in a report on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it believes the exchange rate against the U.S. dollar is not trading according to economic fundamentals, and has bought more than $85 billion since 2008.\par \par \uc2 The report said it was difficult to fully assess the impact of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but found that in 90 percent of cases, purchases caused an immediate shekel weakening that lasted for 40-60 trading days. In 2009-2011 and 2013-2017 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciated the shekel by 2-3 percent, while bigger \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  caused a 4-6 percent weakening.\par \par \uc2 "The impact that was measured is only of purchases that were unexpected in their timing, and not due to the actual existence of a purchasing regime," the report said. "The fact that \uc2 the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  from time to time in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market can, in and of itself, have an impact on the exchange rate level over time."\par \par \uc2 The purchases - started by former governor \uc2 Stanley Fischer\uc2  - have been hailed by exporters but some analysts believe they should be stopped to fully allow market forces to determine the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 For full report click:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.boi.org.il/en/NewsAndPublications/PressReleases/Pages/02-07-2018.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.boi.org.il/en/NewsAndPublications/PressReleases/Pages/02-07-2018.aspx}}}\uc2  (Reporting by Steven Scheer Editing by Catherine Evans)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2018-7-5T10:36:57.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020180702ee7200d9t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
