\par\par \b \uc2 BOI holds an international conference on  \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange \highlight\uc2  market  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 478 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 2017\par \uc2 ENP Newswire\par \uc2 ENPNEW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2017, Electronic News Publishing. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Release date - 10122017\par \par \uc2 An international conference organized by \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2 , in collaboration with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Switzerland (SNB) and the \uc2 Centre for Economic Policy Research\uc2  (CEPR) on \u8216\'20\'18\b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Conventional or Unconventional Policy?\u8217\'20\'19 took place in Jerusalem on December 7-8, 2017.\par \par \uc2 At the conference, research papers were presented by researchers from various countries. The researchers serve in a range of positions in academia, central banks (including \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2 ) and in other international institutions. In addition, there was a keynote lecture by Professor \uc2 Maurice Obstfeld\uc2 , Economic Counsellor and Director of Research at the IMF, and a professional panel on monetary policy instruments was held, with the participation of representatives of central banks.\par \par \uc2 The international conference held by \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2 , in collaboration with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Switzerland (SNB) and the \uc2 Centre for Economic Policy Research\uc2  (CEPR) on \u8216\'20\'18\b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Conventional or Unconventional Policy?\u8217\'20\'19 took place in Jerusalem on December 7-8, 2017. Researchers from academia, central banks, international institutions from around the world, as well as \uc2 Bank of Israel\uc2  representatives, participated.\par \par \uc2 Governor of the Bank of Israel Dr. Karnit Flug, in her opening remarks to the conference, said that \uc2 the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to prevent, to the extent possible, the undesired negative effects on exports, by moderating the overappreciation of the shekel. The Governor emphasized that the policy is sufficiently flexible to allow the economy\u8217\'20\'19s fundamental forces to be expressed nonetheless, as was reflected in the cumulative appreciation of approximately 20 percent in the exchange rate since the beginning of 2009.\par \par \uc2 Economists from the SNB, \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2 , the \uc2 IMF\uc2 , as well as from leading universities worldwide, presented and discussed research dealing with theoretical and empirical aspects of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and in exchange rate policy.\par \par \uc2 Professor \uc2 Maurice Obstfeld\uc2 , Economic Counsellor and Director of Research at the IMF, gave the keynote lecture, in which he reviewed the main dilemmas of policy, given the tension between basic goals of monetary policy-macroeconomic stability and financial stability considerations.\par \par \uc2 The conference\u8217\'20\'19s first day concluded with a professional panel led by Andrew Filardo of the BIS, with participation by representatives of the central banks of the Czech Republic, Denmark, Iceland, and Israel-all small and open economies, though with different characteristics of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market policy.\par \par \uc2 Professor Alex Cukierman, a past member of \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Monetary Committee, addressed the conference and reviewed the similarities and differences in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market policies between Israel and Switzerland.\par \par \uc2 The papers presented at the Conference are available at \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  website:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.boi.org.il/en/Research/ConferencesAndSeminars/Pages/december2017.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.boi.org.il/en/Research/ConferencesAndSeminars/Pages/december2017.aspx}}}\par \par \uc2 [Editorial queries for this story should be sent to newswire@enpublishing.co.uk]\par \par \uc2 Dokument ENPNEW0020171212edcc00030\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
