\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Bank of Israel raises adequate  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  reserves level to $70-$110 bln\b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2015\par 14:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, quote, shekel reaction)\par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM, March 30 (Reuters) - \uc2 The Bank of Israel\uc2  raised the level of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves it deems adequate to hold on Monday, a move that leaves more room to maneuver should it need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stabilise the shekel.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it raised the range to $70-$110 billion from a level of $65-$90 billion set in 2010. The country's foreign reserves grew by $4 billion in 2014 to a total of $86.1 billion, it said.\par \par \uc2 Having an adequate level of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  "helps the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  do its job," the bank said in its 2014 report on foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to stabilise the shekel. It bought $7 billion in 2014 in an effort to moderate exchange rate volatility and offset the effect that new natural gas production may have on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The new adequacy level represents 23-36 percent of the 2014 gross domestic product and is actually less than the 28-39 percent level of the range in 2010, due to the strengthening of the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The shekel weakened to 3.97 per dollar at 1157 GMT, compared with 3.9627 right before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's announcement. (Reporting by Ari Rabinovitch; Editing by Tova Cohen and Tom Heneghan) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-3-30T13:09:22.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150330eb3u00ctl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
