\par\par \b \uc2 Market  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Raises  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Currency \highlight\uc2  Reserves in April\b0\par\par\uc2 By Sara Toth Stub   \par \uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 2013\par 11:19\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Special to DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM--Israel's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose on the month in April, reflecting partly \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's purchase of dollars in an attempt to tame the shekel's ongoing rise, \uc2 the Bank of Israel\uc2  said Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The reserves rose to $77.15 billion from $76.98 billion, with about $100 million of that rise coming from the bank purchasing dollars on the open market.\par \par \uc2 The bank confirmed in April that it had made a dollar-purchase during one trading session to help stabilize the shekel. The rest of the rise stemmed from an upward revaluation, partially offset by government transfers abroad, the bank said.\par \par \uc2 The bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market during one trading session in April when the shekel-dollar rate dropped to ILS3.6 per dollar, its lowest level since 2011, the previous time the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The shekel has continued to rise against the dollar, which economists attribute to interest rate differentials, an improving current account balance and the beginning of production of Israeli natural gas, which has reduced the need for companies to buy dollars in order to purchase energy.\par \par \uc2 Traders say there have been at least two other, smaller \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May. Those rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have failed to weaken the shekel for more than a couple of hours. But the bank's actions have had a "psychological effect," as traders now expect further \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the shekel-dollar rate reaches a new low, said Ori Greenfeld, chief economist at Psagot Investment House in Tel Aviv. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't confirmed these rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to Sara Toth Stub at realtimedesklondon@dowjones.com [ 07-05-13 0919GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130507e957000j7\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (israel near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50